    // pipeline, but we state it explicitly for clarity).
    syr2k.compute_root();

    // Pure definition (the scaling by beta):
    //
    //  - We reorder loops so that:
    //      outer:  i (row)
    //      inner:  j (column, contiguous in memory)
    //    This matches the row‑major layout of C (C(j, i) => C[i][j]).
